YAAP Rhubarb "Vegan Life Style" Pacifist 

A few weeks back Jesse Mayer responded to a post in the "didn't get lowest
score"? tread and came up with the idea of a "Vegan Lifestyle
Conduct/Patch" - Jesse also included the words "Nifty little challenge"
and so I couldn't resist ;)

So the "Vegan Lifestyle Conduct" would be Ascending without using/eating
any animal based products - commonly leather/bone/meat/scales and not
killing anything (however it could still be done without pacifism - but
that wouldn't make much sense)

This conduct has really impressed me - it's not all that easy no - however
it does have real world meaning (Vegan Ethics) and requires no
farming/repetition actions

Here is a quick list of what *cannot* be used (IMO)

Armor
All leather / Dragon scale mail / speed water-walking jumping boots / all
gloves except GoP

Rings
Pearl / Ivory

Comestibles / Corpses
Can only use b j F corpses for taming / nutrition / intrinsics / saccing

Spellbooks
Leather

Tools
Unicorn horn, (frost,fire,plenty,tooled)Horn, Drum, Saddle

Weapons
Worm Tooth, Crysknife, Unicorn Horn and Bull-whip (could be others)

Amulets, scrolls, potions and wands all seem to be acceptable.


There are however some debatable items such as;

Cloth - this could come from many sources eg. plant(hemp) or animal(wool)

Leash - "You slip the leash around your Air Elemental/Fog Cloud" and the
ability to leash headless monsters leads me to believe they are magical /
symbolic and not your standard 'Fido' lead

Lamps - Oil can be made from plants or animals (Quaffing oil will not
break vegan conduct)

Candles - You can't avoid using these full stop

And several others on which your views may vary depending on
your personal background / origin.

